## Download
------------

You can get the code from 

`
https://github.com/abhishek-hep/RestFrames
`

------------
## Installation 
------------

Installation uses CMake so make sure you have that and ROOT installed and ready to use.

```
cd RestFrames;
mkdir build;
cd build;

cmake ../;
cmake --build .;
source setup.sh
```
The next time you want to use RestFrames you just need to
`
source RestFrames/build/setup.sh
`


